{"slug":"Universal-Script-FE-Fighter-inspired-by-Gale-21557","_id":"672612db4b8e61cec928bc75","title":"FE Fighter inspired by Gale","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Introducing: FE Fighter\n\nInspired by the original FE Gale, FE Fighter steps into the spotlight as the next-level FE character, packed with powerful abilities, signature moves, and stylish emotes for those who want to make a mark in any game. Get ready to unleash a barrage of explosive attacks and animations that will leave everyone in awe—without any lag or forced resets!\n\nAbilities & Moves\n\n- M1 Punch Combos: Channel your inner fighter with The Strong Punch and Multipunch, inspired by TSB's powerful strikes.\n- Dash & Sprint: Zoom across the map with high-speed dashes and sprints to outmaneuver any foe.\n- Double Jump: Leap to new heights with ease and perform aerial attacks!\n- Funny Drop Kick: For when you want to make an entrance and a statement.\n- Serious Punch: Deliver a devastating, earth-shattering punch when things get real.\n\nEmotes\n\nExpress yourself with iconic emotes designed for FE Fighter:\n- Malevolent Shrine: Show your presence with a dark, imposing energy.\n- Approaching Me?: Invite challengers to step closer… if they dare.\n- Honored One: Channel the energy of a revered fighter with this powerful stance.\n- Shiver Mi Timbers: Bring some goofy pirate vibes to the battlefield.\n- Hollow Purple: Summon the mystical energy of a forbidden technique.\n- Gamble (Goofy): Roll the dice with a quirky, unpredictable twist.\n- Stay Strong: A classic emote for motivation and power!\n\nNo more resets or lag—FE Fighter brings you an optimized, smooth experience so you can keep the action going! WOOOO!","tags":["Fe","Universal"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"h